    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig-00001",
      "class": "unnumbered scaled-down",
      "caption": null,
      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00198:alt:fig-00001-alt",
          "text": "4-Bromo-2-nitrotoluene has a benzene ring. C 1, C 2, and C 4 are bonded to a methyl group, a nitro group, and a bromine atom, respectively."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_16_10_001.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig-00002",
      "class": "unnumbered scaled-down",
      "caption": null,
      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00198:alt:fig-00002-alt",
          "text": "Ortho-nitrotoluene and para-bromotoluene reacteach with bromine and nitric acid to form 4-bromo-2-nitrotoluene. Meta-bromonitrobenzene does not undergo the reaction."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_16_10_002.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig-00003",
      "class": "unnumbered scaled-down",
      "caption": null,
      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00198:alt:fig-00003-alt",
          "text": "Toluene reacts with bromine in the presence of iron tribromide to form ortho- and para-bromotoluene. The same products are formed when bromobenzene reacts with chloromethane in the presence of iron tribromide."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_16_10_003.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig-00004",
      "class": "unnumbered scaled-down",
      "caption": null,
      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00198:alt:fig-00004-alt",
          "text": "4-Bromo-2-nitrobenzene can be formed from benzene via two routes. One of them involves formation of toluene followed by bromination, and the other involves formation of bromobenzene followed by meythylation."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_16_10_004.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "id": "exam-00002",
