              "text": "A reacts with four B groups to form four products which in turn each react with four C groups to form q6 products which in turn react with four D groups to make 64 products."
            },
            "src": "../../media/OChem_16_10_014.jpg",
            "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
          }
        }
